 * every block in the PageBlock union, so the v3 redesign can be judged from one URL instead
 * of clicking every route. See "Foundations", "Atoms", "Focus ring" and "Every remaining
 * block" below. Nothing in this extension touches astro.config.mjs, the WHMCS links, or
 * currency/pricing spans, and no colour hex is hardcoded in this file's own styles — every
 * swatch, bar and box below reads a real custom property, and every hex LABEL is parsed
 * from the actual tokens.css/global.css source text at build time so this page breaks
 * honestly if a token breaks.
 */
