        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {realBlocks.map((block) => <BlockRenderer block={block} />)}

    <section class="section section-tint">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="sample-copy-flag">Sample copy — real block</p>
        <h2>Every remaining block in the system</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          The 14 blocks below already ship on real routes with real content (see <code>src/data/pages.ts</code>).
          The copy shown here is illustrative <strong>SAMPLE</strong> text written only for this gallery — it
