          pricing, and a real customer's consented quote. Do not copy these fixtures into
          <code>src/data/pages.ts</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {sampleOnlyBlocks.map((block) => <BlockRenderer block={block} />)}

    <div class="component-tag">
      <p class="shell">
        Component <code>testimonials</code> — SAMPLE; a repo-wide search finds no real content fed to this
